            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p>Complete the form below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "maxWords": 2,
            "bodyHtml": "<table class=\"q-table\">\n<tr><th>Name of Restaurant</th><th>Location</th><th>Reason for Recommendation</th><th>Other Comments</th></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>The Junction</strong></td><td>Greyson Street, near the station</td><td>Good for people who are especially keen on {{1}}</td><td>Quite expensive. The {{2}} is a good place for a drink.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>Paloma</strong></td><td>In Bow Street, next to the cinema</td><td>{{3}} food, good for sharing</td><td>Staff are very friendly. Need to pay £50 deposit. A limited selection of {{4}} food on the menu.</td></tr>\n<tr><td><strong>The {{5}}</strong></td><td>At the top of a {{6}}</td><td>A famous chef. All the {{7}} are very good. Only uses {{8}} ingredients.</td><td>Set lunch costs: £{{9}} per person. Portions probably of {{10}} size.</td></tr>\n</table>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "instructionsHtml": "Part 2<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 11–16</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "Heather says pottery differs from other art forms because",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "it lasts longer in the ground."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "it is practised by more people."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "it can be repaired more easily."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "Archaeologists sometimes identify the use of ancient pottery from",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "the clay it was made with."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "the marks that are on it."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "the basic shape of it."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "Some people join Heather's pottery class because they want to",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "create an item that looks very old."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "find something that they are good at."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "make something that will outlive them."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "What does Heather value most about being a potter?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "its calming effect"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "its messy nature"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "its physical benefits"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "Most of the visitors to Edelman Pottery",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "bring friends to join courses."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "have never made a pot before."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "try to learn techniques too quickly."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "Heather reminds her visitors that they should",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "put on their aprons."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "change their clothes."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "take off their jewellery."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 17 and 18</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> things does Heather explain about kilns?</p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 17,
                "textHtml": "Which <strong>TWO</strong> things does Heather explain about kilns?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "what their function is"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "when they were invented"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "ways of keeping them safe"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "where to put one in your home"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "what some people use instead of one"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-3",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 19 and 20</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> points does Heather make about a potter's tools?</p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 19,
                "textHtml": "Which <strong>TWO</strong> points does Heather make about a potter's tools?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "Some are hard to hold."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "Some are worth buying."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "Some are essential items."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "Some have memorable names."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "Some are available for use by participants."
                  }
                ]
