          {
            "id": "part-3-group-3",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 2,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 25 and 26</h3><p>Choose <strong>TWO</strong> letters, <strong>A–E</strong>.</p><p>Which <strong>TWO</strong> opinions do both the students express about the evolutionary theory of loneliness?</p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 25,
                "textHtml": "Which <strong>TWO</strong> opinions do both the students express about the evolutionary theory of loneliness?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "It has little practical relevance."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "It needs further investigation."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "It is misleading."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "D",
                    "textHtml": "It should be more widely accepted."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "E",
                    "textHtml": "It is difficult to understand."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-3-group-4",
            "type": "mcq",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 27–30</h3><p>Choose the correct letter, <strong>A</strong>, <strong>B</strong> or <strong>C</strong>.</p><p><strong>Loneliness and mental health</strong></p>",
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 27,
                "textHtml": "When comparing loneliness to depression, the students",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "doubt that there will ever be a medical cure for loneliness."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "claim that the link between loneliness and mental health is overstated."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "express frustration that loneliness is not taken more seriously."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 28,
                "textHtml": "Why do the students decide to start their presentation with an example from their own experience?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "to explain how difficult loneliness can be"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "to highlight a situation that most students will recognise"
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "to emphasise that feeling lonely is more common for men than women"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 29,
                "textHtml": "The students agree that talking to strangers is a good strategy for dealing with loneliness because",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "it creates a sense of belonging."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "it builds self-confidence."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "it makes people feel more positive."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 30,
                "textHtml": "The students find it difficult to understand why solitude is considered to be",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "similar to loneliness."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "necessary for mental health."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "an enjoyable experience."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
